k","t":"The footer is KTPH000on by defaultKTPH001 and appears in every exported format that has one: the bottom line of each PDF page, the last line of a Markdown export, and the footer of the exported journal page. Page numbers stay in the PDF footer regardless of this setting.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":35950,"e":36138,"k":"block","t":"Leaving the text field empty uses the built-in line, which names korTTY and appends the repository link (clickable in the PDF). A text of your own replaces it completely, without the link.","f":[]},{"s":36146,"e":36206,"k":"block","t":"Turning the footer off removes it from all of those formats.","f":[]},{"s":37084,"e":37099,"k":"text","t":"\n  Back to top\n","f":[]},{"s":37342,"e":37383,"k":"text","t":"MIT-licensed · Developed by Daniel Mengel","f":[]},{"s":37429,"e":37441,"k":"text","t":"\n    korTTY ","f":[]},{"s":37449,"e":37456,"k":"text","t":"v2.10.0","f":[]}]}